OL,3,GNEWSA'I built my own home to beat the
OL,4,ALondon housing crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's not easy to find an affordable
OL,7,Fplace to live in the capital so
OL,8,Fbuilding your own home might seem
OL,9,Fappealing if you are struggling to get
OL,10,Fon the housing ladder or keep up with
OL,11,Fthe rent.
OL,13,FIn 1990s London, some housing
OL,14,Fcooperatives built whole streets of
OL,15,Fsocial housing, sharing knowledge and
OL,16,Fconstruction skills between them.
OL,18,FBut, 30 years on, can this approach
OL,19,Fwork effectively while meeting today's
OL,20,Ftighter building regulations?
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
